# 🔍 Threat Hunting & IoC Investigation

## 📄 Overview
In this project, I performed threat hunting across a simulated enterprise environment to identify Indicators of Compromise (IoCs), investigate suspicious activity, validate legitimate behavior, and determine the source of potential threats.

This investigation followed a SOC-style workflow:
- Analyze logs and network activity
- Validate suspicious behavior
- Eliminate false positives
- Identify and confirm malicious activity
- Recommend remediation actions

---

## 🖥️ Environment
- DC10 – Windows Server 2019 (Domain Controller / Web Server)
- MS10 – Windows Server 2016
- PC10 – Windows Server 2019 (Client System)
- LAMP – Ubuntu Linux Server
- Kali – Penetration Testing System

